<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/8 (FIM 205.99).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/8 (FIM 205.99).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR unchanged at $45-1/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 205.99 markka. In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed down 0.50 markka at 205.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-1/4 at $32-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.75 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.90 markka at 74.10.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Monday after closing down $0-5/8 at $19-3/4 on in New York last Thursday.</p>
<p>Rauma closed up 1.00 markka at 90.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
